					text = string.Concat(new string[]
					{
						"Honecker was forced to interrupt his participation in the meeting, on the evening he was taken to the Romanian government clinic with biliary colic. After the preliminary stabilization of the health of Honecker, surgery was carried out to remove the inflamed gall bladder and the part of the large intestine. According to the urologist Peter Althouse, during the operation it was found, but due to the patient's poor condition, the supposedly cancers were not removed in the right kidney, which Honecker was not informed about. Due to his condition until about September of this year, he will not be able to personally perform his duties. Maybe it's time to change the manual?| Egon Krenz, one of the representatives of the moderate wing of the ",
						this.global1.party_name[0],
