					text2 = "The Mongolian Revolution";
					text = "We have just received information about the national demonestrations in Mongolia. The first public demonstrations began in Ulaanbaatar in front of the Youth Palace, when Tsakhiagiin Elbegdorj announced the creation of the Mongolian Democratic Union. The demonstrators urge the government of the country to follow the USSR in the policy of Glasnost and Perestroika, hold multi-party elections. The number of demonstrators has already increased to a thousand, and rallies have moved to Sukhbaatar Square. Given the situation in the country, urgent measures must be taken if we do not want fall of the MPR regime. The leader of Mongolia is already preparing his appeal to the Politburo with a plea for their complete resignation and legalization of Western freedoms... But can we have a chance to remove him by putting pressure on the right persons and urging others to preserve power? Or Soviet socialism with a human face is the natural development of Marxism-Leninism?..";
