				else if (this.global1.number_event == 120)
				{
					text2 = "Ludmila's group";
					text = "The rapid rise of Lyudmila Zhivkova made a bad impression in the communist milieu and, due to the weakness to her antics from Zhivkov himself, caused damage to his own authority. This is due to her eccentric behavior and unorthodox conceptual views, because according to the words of the closest Zhivkov's associates, his daughter propagated such theses: «Marxism was strongly intertwined with Buddhist and occult views». Thanks to the daughter of the general secretary, a group of liberal-minded party members was formed in the party. Maybe it's time, in spite of the memory of the deeds of the daughter, to attack all those who were close to her, in order to avoid excesses? Or is it time to learn from her experience?";
