					else
					{
						text = "More than fifty years ago the famous Bulgarian communist Georgi Dimitrov died. With the participation of the Soviet Union, a mausoleum was erected in Sofia, where the body of the general secretary still lies. However, some party members believe that the corpse in the center of the capital is a relic of the Stalinist past and we need to turn it into the Museum of Bulgarian Communism, using the living relatives of Dimitrov.";
