				else if (this.global1.number_event == 125)
				{
					text2 = "Place your bets!";
					text = "The economic situation in the country is deteriorating and we need to find a new source of income. As you know, gambling is prohibited in our country, and people only have to play in state lotteries. And this is not taking into account the fact that illegal gambling houses are constantly being organized, in which a lot of money are being lost that could help our economy. True, the creation of a fully public Las Vegas can cost us too much. Maybe it's worth attracting some private individuals by making appropriate easing in the laws?";
